<title>UK: Telkom at $31.875 in London at 0829 GMT.</title>
<headline>Telkom at $31.875 in London at 0829 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telkom traded at $31.875 and London at 0829 GMT on Monday. It recorded the day's low of $31.85 and the day's high of $31.875</p>
<p>Its previous close on Friday $31.85. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
